        "liquid": "<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap');\n\n  .mf-story-section {\n    width: 100%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 22px 16px 30px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .mf-story-block {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto 44px;\n  }\n\n  .mf-story-block:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .mf-story-video-wrap {\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    line-height: 0;\n  }\n\n  .mf-story-video {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    margin: 0;\n    border: 0;\n    object-fit: cover;\n  }\n\n  .mf-story-title {\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n    color: #161616;\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n    font-size: 38px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.08;\n    letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n  }\n\n  .mf-story-title .mf-pink {\n    color: #B3437A;\n  }\n\n  .mf-story-text {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #303030;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n  }\n\n  .mf-story-text + .mf-story-text {\n    margin-top: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .mf-story-text strong {\n    color: #242424;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {\n    .mf-story-section {\n      padding: 42px 38px 56px;\n    }\n\n    .mf-story-block {\n      margin-bottom: 58px;\n    }\n\n    .mf-story-video-wrap {\n      margin-bottom: 30px;\n      border-radius: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .mf-story-title {\n      font-size: 42px;\n    }\n\n    .mf-story-text {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {\n    .mf-story-section {\n      padding: 14px 15px 28px;\n    }\n\n    .mf-story-block {\n      margin-bottom: 38px;\n    }\n\n    .mf-story-video-wrap {\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n      border-radius: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .mf-story-title {\n      font-size: 31px;\n      line-height: 1.08;\n    }\n\n    .mf-story-text {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"mf-story-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"mf-story-block\">\n    <div class=\"mf-story-video-wrap\">\n      <video\n        class=\"mf-story-video\"\n        autoplay\n        muted\n        loop\n        playsinline\n        preload=\"metadata\"\n      >\n        <source\n          src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/047c8341fbe844b28e125c375cabf9a1.mp4\"\n          type=\"video/mp4\"\n        >\n      </video>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"mf-story-title\">\n      Retrouvez un ventre<br>\n      <span class=\"mf-pink\">plat et votre confiance</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"mf-story-text\">\n      Si vous voulez sentir votre <strong>ventre plat et soutenu</strong> toute la journée,\n      la culotte Mi Forma est faite pour vous.\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"mf-story-text\">\n      Grâce à sa <strong>compression 360°</strong> et à sa <strong>bande croisée</strong>,\n      elle lisse le ventre devant, sur les côtés et dans le dos, sans serrer ni glisser.\n      Le résultat&nbsp;: une <strong>silhouette redessinée instantanément</strong> et cette\n      confiance de vous sentir bien dans ce que vous portez.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mf-story-block\">\n    <div class=\"mf-story-video-wrap\">\n      <video\n        class=\"mf-story-video\"\n        autoplay\n        muted\n        loop\n        playsinline\n        preload=\"metadata\"\n      >\n        <source\n          src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/93ad6ac3d25448308b57515115fa7ac1.mp4\"\n          type=\"video/mp4\"\n        >\n      </video>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"mf-story-title\">\n      Elle reste en place. Elle ne bouge pas.<br>\n      <span class=\"mf-pink\">Toute la journée.</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"mf-story-text\">\n      Le <strong>tissu léger</strong> épouse votre corps <strong>sans glisser</strong>.\n      Aucun pli, pas besoin de la remettre en place toutes les cinq minutes. Vous\n      l’enfilez au réveil et <strong>vous l’oubliez</strong> jusqu’au soir.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.mf-story-video').forEach(function (video) {\n      video.muted = true;\n      video.play().catch(function () {});\n    });\n  })();\n</script>",
